{
  "sections": {
    "hero_ultra_repair": {
      "type": "montibello-image-banner",
      "blocks": {},
      "block_order": [],
      "name": "Banner Montibello",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "full",
        "section_width": "full-width",
        "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-ultra-repair-hero.jpg",
        "image_alt": "Montibello HOP Ultra Repair — gama completa",
        "toggle_overlay": false,
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
    "intro_ultra_repair": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "intro_group": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "column",
            "width": "custom",
            "custom_width": 50,
            "width_mobile": "fill",
            "height": "fit"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "heading": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h1>Ultra Repair</h1>",
                "type_preset": "h1",
                "max_width": "none"
              }
            },
            "text": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Rutina reparadora y nutritiva que reconstruye y fortalece los cabellos dañados químicamente, térmicamente o por factores medioambientales. Enriquecida con Colágeno vegano, un complejo de proteínas de origen vegetal que rellenan y restauran la fibra capilar.</p>",
                "type_preset": "rte",
                "max_width": "none"
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "heading",
            "text"
          ]
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "intro_group"
      ],
      "name": "Sección",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "{{ settings.color_palette.background }}",
        "padding-block-start": 25,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
    "range_title_styles": {
      "type": "montibello-range-title",
      "settings": {}
    },
    "results_ultra_repair": {
      "type": "montibello-stats-panel",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "text",
          "static": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Cuidado intensivo 24/7 para tu cabello dañado.</h2>",
            "type_preset": "h2",
            "max_width": "normal"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [],
      "name": "Panel de datos Ultra Repair",
      "settings": {
        "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-ultra-repair-results.webp",
        "image_alt": "Montibello HOP Ultra Repair — cuidado intensivo",
        "media_position": "left",
        "toggle_label": "Ver resultados",
        "stat_1_number": "125%",
        "stat_1_label": "cabello más fuerte*",
        "stat_2_number": "x5",
        "stat_2_label": "más hidratación*",
        "stat_3_number": "x4",
        "stat_3_label": "menos encrespamiento*",
        "stat_4_number": "x4",
        "stat_4_label": "cabello más sedoso*",
        "footnote": "* Desde la primera aplicación. Test instrumental. Shampoo, rinse y sealed ends de la gama hop Ultra Repair.",
        "bundled_file": "none",
        "file_label": "",
        "section_width": "full-width",
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
    "technology_ultra_repair": {
      "type": "montibello-image-banner",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>LifeAlgae Bioscience + Colágeno Vegano</h2>",
            "type_preset": "h2",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "padding-block-end": 12
          }
        },
        "text_1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Combinación de algas que amplifica y potencia las moléculas activas, sus efectos se multiplican x4 permitiendo actuar sobre cuero cabelludo y cabello.</p>",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "max_width": "normal"
          }
        },
        "text_2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Colágeno Vegano: un complejo de proteínas de origen vegetal que rellena, fortalece y restaura la fibra capilar a la vez que proporciona brillo, elasticidad y suavidad.</p><ul><li>Repara</li><li>Rellena</li><li>Fortalece</li><li>Restaura</li><li>Protege contra la rotura</li></ul>",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "max_width": "normal"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text_1",
        "text_2"
      ],
      "name": "Banner Montibello",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "split",
        "media_position": "right",
        "section_width": "full-width",
        "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-repair-collagen-vegano.jpg",
        "image_alt": "LifeAlgae Bioscience + Colágeno Vegano — Montibello HOP Ultra Repair",
        "toggle_overlay": false,
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
